<title>HUNGARY: CESI continues to fall, ends at 1,607.65 points.</title>
<headline>CESI continues to fall, ends at 1,607.65 points.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index continued to ease on Thursday to close at 1,607.65 points, down 10.34 points or 0.64 percent, the Budapest Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The index, which has been published since February 1, 1996, reflects trends of 73 shares on the Budapest, Prague, Warsaw, Bratislava and Ljubljana bourses.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
